---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../components/QuoteForm.jsx';
import {services,areas,photo} from '../data';
---
<Layout><section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> YOUR SPACE, AT ITS BEST</div><h1>A little clean.<br/>A lot of <span class="serif">calm.</span><svg viewBox="0 0 280 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 14 Q130 -4 275 9"/></svg></h1><p>Come home to a fresh start. Thoughtful, professional cleaning for your home, your workspace, and everything in between.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#quote">Find your fresh start <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#services">Explore our services <span>→</span></a></div><div class="hero-reassurance"><span class="round-check">✓</span><div>Made for your space.<small>Personal care. Professional clean.</small></div><span class="mini-star">✧</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img src={photo('photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0')} alt="Sunlit living room with a cream sofa, natural textures and leafy plants" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="image-label"><span class="round-check">✓</span><div>A fresh space. A fresh feeling.<small>Leave the cleaning to us.</small></div></div><div class="hero-stamp">LESS MESS<br/><span>✳</span><br/>MORE LIFE</div><span class="photo-credit">Spaces that inspire · illustrative photography</span></div></section><div class="trust-strip"><span>Care in every corner.</span><span>✧ Tailored to your space</span><span>✧ Professional cleaning team</span><span>✧ Homes & businesses</span><span>✧ Across Metro Manila & beyond</span></div>
<section id="services" class="section wrap"><div class="section-head reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">A CLEAN FOR EVERY KIND OF SPACE</div><h2>Your mess.<br/>Our kind of <span class="serif">work.</span></h2></div><p>From everyday upkeep to a top-to-bottom reset,<br class="desktop"/> we make clean feel effortless.</p></div><div class="services-grid">{services.map((s,i)=><a class:list={['service-card','reveal',i===0&&'featured']} href={`/services/${s.slug}`}><div class="service-photo"><img src={photo(s.image,650)} alt={s.name==='Steam cleaning'?'Soft sofa and cushions':`${s.name} — an inviting, well-kept space`} loading="lazy"/><span class="service-number">0{i+1}</span><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></div><h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.tag}</p></a>)}</div></section>
<section id="difference" class="difference"><div class="wrap difference-inner"><div class="difference-photo reveal"><img src={photo('photo-1581578731548-c64695cc6952',900)} alt="Cleaning professional carefully wiping a surface" loading="lazy"/><div class="photo-tag">A little care goes a long way. ✳</div></div><div class="difference-copy reveal"><div class="eyebrow">MORE THAN A CLEAN SPACE</div><h2>We take care of it.<br/>You take a <span class="serif">breather.</span></h2><p>Life gets busy. Your to-do list gets longer. We’re here to give you back a little time, and a space that feels good to be in.</p><div class="benefit"><span>01</span><div><h3>Your space, your clean</h3><p>A cleaning plan shaped around what you actually need.</p></div></div><div class="benefit"><span>02</span><div><h3>Good people. Thoughtful care.</h3><p>A professional team that respects your space and your time.</p></div></div><div class="benefit"><span>03</span><div><h3>Clear from the start</h3><p>We confirm the scope, schedule, and quote before you book.</p></div></div><a class="text-link" href="#process">Get to know our process →</a></div></div></section>
<section id="our-work" class="section wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE FRESH-START FILES</div><h2>Small details.<br/><span class="serif">Big difference.</span></h2></div><p>Explore the kinds of spaces we care for.<br/>Project photos will be added after client approval.</p></div><div class="gallery" data-gallery><div class="filter-row" role="group" aria-label="Filter spaces">{['All spaces','Home','Office','Deep clean'].map((s,i)=><button data-filter={s} class:list={['filter',i===0&&'active']} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}>{s}</button>)}</div><div class="gallery-grid">{[{cat:'Home',title:'A calmer place to come home to',img:services[0].image},{cat:'Office',title:'A workspace, ready for a new day',img:services[1].image},{cat:'Deep clean',title:'A fresh start in every corner',img:services[2].image}].map(s=><figure data-category={s.cat}><img src={photo(s.img,800)} alt={s.title} loading="lazy"/><figcaption><span>{s.cat}</span><h3>{s.title}</h3><small>Illustrative space · not a Linis Co project</small></figcaption></figure>)}</div></div><div class="review-banner"><span class="review-icon">“</span><div><h3>Real feedback. From real people.</h3><p>Get to know Linis Co through the community on our Facebook page.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://www.facebook.com/liniscoph/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Visit our Facebook page ↗</a></div></section>
<section id="process" class="process section"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">FROM TO-DO TO TA-DA</div><h2>Fresh starts are <span class="serif">simple.</span></h2><div class="process-grid">{[{n:'01',title:'Tell us about your space',text:'Choose a service and share your location. Add photos or extra details in Messenger.'},{n:'02',title:'Make a plan together',text:'We confirm your cleaning needs, your personal quote, and an available schedule.'},{n:'03',title:'Leave the clean to us',text:'Secure valuables, clear access, and let us know about delicate surfaces. Then take a breather.'}].map(p=><div><span class="step-number">{p.n} <span>↗</span></span><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.text}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="areas" class="section wrap area-section"><div><div class="eyebrow">A FRESH START, NEAR YOU</div><h2>Local care.<br/><span class="serif">A little further.</span></h2><p>Based in Pasig, serving spaces across Metro Manila and nearby provinces. Share your exact location to confirm availability and travel arrangements.</p></div><div class="area-links">{areas.map(a=><a href={`/areas/${a.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-')}`}>{a}<span>↗</span></a>)}<a class="area-other" href="#quote">Somewhere else? Let’s talk <span>→</span></a></div></section>
<section id="quote" class="quote-section"><div class="wrap quote-inner"><div class="quote-copy"><div class="eyebrow">LESS ON YOUR LIST. MORE IN YOUR DAY.</div><h2>Ready for that<br/><span class="serif">fresh-space feeling?</span></h2><p>Let’s find the right clean for you. Share a few details and start a conversation with our team.</p><div class="pricing-note"><span>↗</span><div><h3>A quote that fits your space.</h3><p>Your price depends on the service, floor area, condition, location, and any special requests. We agree on the scope and total before you confirm.</p></div></div><a href="tel:+639618062218" class="phone-link">Prefer a quick call?<strong>+63 961 806 2218 ↗</strong></a></div><QuoteForm client:load/></div></section>
<section class="section wrap faq"><div><div class="eyebrow">GOOD TO KNOW</div><h2>A little <span class="serif">clarity.</span></h2></div><div>{[{q:'How much does a cleaning service cost?',a:'Every space is different. Tell us the service, location, approximate floor area and condition. The team will confirm a personalized quotation before you book.'},{q:'Do I need to provide cleaning supplies?',a:'Ask the team to confirm the equipment and supplies included in your specific quote. Tell us about allergies, pets, delicate finishes, and building restrictions beforehand.'},{q:'Can I choose my cleaning date?',a:'Yes. Share your preferred date in your enquiry. A booking is confirmed only when the team agrees on the scope, price, and available schedule.'},{q:'What should I do before the team arrives?',a:'Secure valuables and personal documents, clear access to the areas being cleaned, and arrange building entry if needed. Discuss water, power, parking and any fragile materials with the team.'}].map(f=><details><summary>{f.q}<span>+</span></summary><p>{f.a}</p></details>)}</div></section>
<script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const value=button.getAttribute('data-filter');document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('active',b===button);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button))});document.querySelectorAll('[data-category]').forEach(card=>{(card as HTMLElement).hidden=value!=='All spaces'&&card.getAttribute('data-category')!==value})}));</script>
</Layout>
